  "content": "\n\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/9TYytCO.png\" width=\"488\" height=\"189\"></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p><a href=\"https://discord.gg/kc2YGgk\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/discord/554379889122213888.svg?label=Join us on Discord&logo=discord&logoColor=FFFFFF&style=flat-square\" alt=\"Discord\"></a></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span style=\"font-weight:400\">Mekanism Generators 為 Mekanism 的官方擴充模組，新增多種發電機與產能方式。若無此模組，您將需依賴其他模組來為您的 Mekanism 機器提供能源。</span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span style=\"font-weight:400\">功能特色：</span></p>\n<ul>\n<li style=\"font-weight:400\"><span style=\"font-weight:400\">熱能發電機</span></li>\n<li style=\"font-weight:400\"><span style=\"font-weight:400\">瓦斯燃燒發電機</span></li>\n<li style=\"font-weight:400\"><span style=\"font-weight:400\">生物發電機</span></li>\n<li style=\"font-weight:400\"><span style=\"font-weight:400\">太陽能發電機</span></li>\n<li style=\"font-weight:400\"><span style=\"font-weight:400\">進階太陽能發電機</span></li>\n<li style=\"font-weight:400\"><span style=\"font-weight:400\">風力發電機</span></li>\n<li style=\"font-weight:400\"><span style=\"font-weight:400\">核分裂反應爐</span></li>\n<li style=\"font-weight:400\"><span style=\"font-weight:400\">核融合反應爐</span></li>\n<li style=\"font-weight:400\"><span style=\"font-weight:400\">渦輪機</span></li>\n</ul>\n<p><br><br></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-weight:400\">其他 Mekanism 模組連結：</span></p>\n<ul>\n<li style=\"font-weight:400\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/mekanism\" rel=\"nofollow\"><span style=\"font-weight:400\">Mekanism</span></a></li>\n<li style=\"font-weight:400\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/mekanism-additions\" rel=\"nofollow\"><span style=\"font-weight:400\">Mekanism Additions</span></a></li>\n<li style=\"font-weight:400\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/mekanism-tools\" rel=\"nofollow\"><span style=\"font-weight:400\">Mekanism Tools</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><strong>文件</strong>&nbsp;可於 Mekanism 的 <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=http%253a%252f%252fwiki.aidancbrady.com%252fwiki%252fMain_Page\" rel=\"nofollow\">官方維基</a> 查閱，該維基由 <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=http%253a%252f%252fwww.indiewikis.com%252f\" rel=\"nofollow\">IndieWikis</a> 自豪地託管！目前內容仍在持續完善中，若您有能力，歡迎積極貢獻！</p>\n<p><strong>原始碼&nbsp;</strong>已開放於 <strong><a href=\"https://github.com/mekanism-mod/Mekanism\" rel=\"nofollow\">GitHub</a></strong>！</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><strong>支持團隊&nbsp;</strong>可透過 Patreon：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.patreon.com/user?u=260704\" rel=\"nofollow\">aidancbrady</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.patreon.com/pupnewfster\" rel=\"nofollow\">pupnewfster</a></li>\n</ul>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><strong>支持團隊&nbsp;</strong>可透過 Ko-fi：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fko-fi.com%252fpupnewfster\" rel=\"nofollow\">pupnewfster</a></li>\n</ul>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>",
